      "text": "cos 2t."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 146.24,
      "end": 147.71,
      "duration": 1.47,
      "text": "So, now let's represent this delta"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 147.72,
      "end": 150.35,
      "duration": 2.63,
      "text": "function here."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 150.36,
      "end": 153.03,
      "duration": 2.67,
      "text": "So, this is just our zero axis"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 153.04,
      "end": 155.83,
      "duration": 2.79,
      "text": "and the delta here is zero everywhere"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 155.84,
      "end": 158.15,
      "duration": 2.31,
      "text": "except at two where we would represent"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 158.16,
      "end": 160.71,
      "duration": 2.55,
      "text": "it again with an arrow and amplitude"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 160.72,
      "end": 162.87,
      "duration": 2.15,
      "text": "one, okay? So, this"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 162.88,
      "end": 165.59,
