      "index": 94,
      "start": 239.16,
      "end": 242.11,
      "duration": 2.95,
      "text": "us zero. It's like the delta fell off of"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 242.12,
      "end": 243.67,
      "duration": 1.55,
      "text": "our interval of integration, so we're"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 243.68,
      "end": 246.55,
      "duration": 2.87,
      "text": "just left with a zero function."
