    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 246.56,
      "end": 250.79,
      "duration": 4.23,
      "text": "So, let's move to the second part."
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 252.43,
      "end": 252.44,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "The second part asks us to find the"
